#
# Only send the mobile app to EAS Build. The repository has many extra folders
# (backend, frontend, evidencias, etc.) that cause permission issues when EAS
# unpacks the archive in Linux. This file keeps the upload small and clean.
#

# Ignore everything by default
*

!.easignore
!fase_2
fase_2/*
!fase_2/proyectos
fase_2/proyectos/*
!fase_2/proyectos/MobileManualInventory
!fase_2/proyectos/MobileManualInventory/**
